{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2020-12-09 09:14:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER DEADLINE: PAWAR LAW GROUP ANNOUNCES A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION F/K/A RAYTHEON COMPANY; IMPORTANT DEADLINE– RTX', 'text': 'NEW YORK, DEC. 09, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PAWAR LAW GROUP ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION F/K/A RAYTHEON COMPANY (NYSE: RTX) FROM FEBRUARY 10, 2016 THROUGH OCTOBER 27, 2020, INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”). THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER DAMAGES FOR RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES CORPORATION INVESTORS UNDER THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS.'}